<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59611" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράμβ-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cabbage, Brassica cretica</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Batr.
				163
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Hippon.
				37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Telecl.
				27
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				1.121.30
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, etc.; of three kinds, <i><span class="en">
				Eudem.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.369d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				85
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάφανος</span>
			 (q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				551a16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἥμερος, ἀγρία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.120
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				121
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. θαλασσία</span>, <i>sea-cole,
				Convolvulus Soldanella</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				122
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὰ τὴν κράμβην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anan.
					4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				25
			</span></i>, or 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὰ τὰς κράμβας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					74
				</span></i>
			, Comic form of oath to avoid sacred names, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.370b
			</span></i>.</div>
